<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Cambiar contraseña | GastroCloud</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css" />
  </head>
  <body class="login-body">
    <main class="login-card">
      <h1>Protege tu cuenta de soporte</h1>
      <p>Antes de continuar, elige una contraseña de al menos 12 caracteres.</p>
      <form method="post" action="/soporte/cambiar-clave" class="login-form">
        <label>Contraseña actual <input type="password" class="form-control" name="currentPassword" required /></label>
        <label>Nueva contraseña <input type="password" class="form-control" name="password" minlength="12" maxlength="72" required /></label>
        <button class="btn btn-light">Guardar contraseña</button>
      </form>
      <form method="post" action="/auth/logout" class="mt-3"><button class="btn btn-outline-light">Cerrar sesión</button></form>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
